{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightSystemScope","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightSystemScope","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.MarkovNormalisation","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.WenzlWeightVanishing"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.not_isOcneanuWeightSystem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.not_isOcneanuWeightSystem","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightSystemScope.lean#L70-L104","doc":"**The corpus's normalised weight cannot satisfy `IsOcneanuWeightSystem` as stated.**\nThe class asks for a **single** normaliser `Z`, independent of the diagram; the bridge supplies\n`(q²+1)^{|μ|}`, which is not. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_oneCell_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_oneCell_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightSystemScope.lean#L61-L68","doc":"The single-cell diagram has weight `1 / 1`… we only need it nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0}]}